{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:39:50+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:39:50+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"ASML Holding N.V.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"Netherlands","city":"Veldhoven","website":"https://www.asml.com","employees":44681,"summary":"ASML Holding N.V. provides lithography solutions for the development, production, marketing, sales, upgrading, and servicing of advanced semiconductor equipment systems. The company offers lithography, metrology, and inspection systems. It also provides extreme ultraviolet lithography systems; and deep ultraviolet lithography systems comprising immersion and dry lithography systems solutions to manufacture various range of semiconductor nodes and technologies. In addition, the company offers metrology and inspection systems, including YieldStar optical metrology systems, a diffraction-based wafer metrology platform to assess the quality of patterns on the wafers; and HMI electron beam solutions to locate and analyze individual chip defects. Further, it provides computational lithography solutions, and lithography systems and control software solutions; and refurbishes and upgrades lithography systems, as well as offers customer support and related services. Additionally, the company offers hardware, software, and services to chipmakers to produce the patterns of integrated circuits. It operates in Japan, South Korea, Singapore, Taiwan, China, rest of Asia, the Netherlands, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the United States. The company was formerly known as ASM Lithography Holding N.V. and changed its name to ASML Holding N.V. in 2001. ASML Holding N.V. was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Veldhoven, the Netherlands.","exchange":"Amsterdam","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"ASML Holding N.V. fournit des solutions de lithographie pour le développement, la production, la commercialisation, la vente, la mise à niveau et l'entretien de systèmes d'équipements semi-conducteurs avancés. La société propose des systèmes de lithographie, de métrologie et d'inspection. Il fournit également des systèmes de lithographie ultraviolette extrême; et des systèmes de lithographie ultraviolette profonde comprenant des solutions de systèmes d'immersion et de lithographie sèche pour fabriquer diverses gammes de nœuds et de technologies semi-conducteurs."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":575737036800,"shares_outstanding":385417742,"trailing_pe":43.832157,"forward_pe":26.70871,"price_to_book":25.937181,"ev_to_ebitda":34.701,"ev_to_revenue":14.225,"dividend_yield":0.0052,"payout_ratio":0.2225,"beta_yahoo":1.302},"targets":{"current_price":1493.8,"mean":2107.7273,"median":2100.0,"high":2600.0,"low":1288.0,"n_analysts":33,"reco_mean":1.36585,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-14"],"eps_avg":15.38838,"eps_low":14.84,"eps_high":16.11,"revenue_avg":14816055140,"ex_dividend":"2026-10-26","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.0001,"institutions_pct":0.48032,"institutions_float_pct":0.48037,"institutions_n":1382,"institutions":[{"name":"Sageworth Trust Company","pct":0.0,"shares":885,"value":1322013,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Sageworth Trust Co of South Dakota","pct":0.0,"shares":300,"value":448140,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Meyer Handelman Co","pct":0.0,"shares":285,"value":425733,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Atlas Capital Advisors Inc","pct":0.0,"shares":1369,"value":2045012,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0654},{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":9640,"value":14400232,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.3346},{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":3668,"value":5479258,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0,"shares":8179,"value"